  "description": "Reggae: laid back at 66 to 84 BPM: the one drop, kick and cross-stick together on the third beat, a hat skipping in swung eighths, a deep melodic bassline that leaves the one empty, guitar and organ skanking on the offbeats, horn lines in the choruses, dub's echoes and spring reverb",
